SUMMARY:BYOP (🎃) - Pumpkin Carving!!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\nHey friends\, it's tim
 e to put on your coziest sweater and get spooky 👻 We will meet in Weave
 rville at **Lake Louise Park** for a pumpkin carving extravaganza on **Sun
  Oct 24th at about 10am**!!\n\nThis event is **BYOP** (Bring Your Own Pump
 kin)\, the some carving tools (brings yours if you have it)\, COFFEE\, and
  a seasonally appropriate dessert will be provided!\n\nThis park has a fir
 st come first serve rule for pavilion/shelters\, I'll get there early to t
 ry to snag one\, BUT if they are taken\, we will pivot and move to the law
 n with large picnic blankets and **camping chairs** (**bring your own just
  in case**\, but I will have a few extras!)\n\nParking is available all ar
 ound the lake and is free (you may have to circle around a couple of times
  to find a spot). If there are questions\, post it in the comments.\n\nLoo
 king forward to getting festive with y'all 🎃 See ya then!\n\n🚨please
  note this is substance free event\, we kindly ask that you refrain from c
 onsuming mind altering substances at our events. This is a space for peopl
 e to enjoy doing a thing without booze/other substances🚨
